# Certora CVL specs — GitHub's linguist has no "CVL" language entry and
# misdetects *.spec as Ruby, inflating the repo's Ruby share (17.2%).
# Linguist excludes unknown-language overrides from the stats, so the
# specs stop counting as Ruby; if CVL is ever added upstream, they will
# simply be classified as CVL automatically.
certora/specs/*.spec linguist-language=CVL
*.cvl linguist-language=CVL
